{
	"name": "Venom Potion",
	"type": "object",
	"img": "icons/magic/acid/dissolve-vomit-green-brown.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>Anyone using one of your potions can apply it to a weapon or food as a bonus action. Applying a potion to an unwilling target requires you to grapple with, or successfully grab on, your target, but allows you to use an action to force-feed the target on a failed Constitution save.</p><p>A weapon coated in venom deals an extra 1d6 of poison damage on up to 4 successful melee weapon attacks. If ingested, the imbiber must make a Constitution save or take 4d6 acid damage and become [[/condition id=poisoned]] for 1 hour, even if they are otherwise immune to the poisoned condition.</p>",
